%% Status: CURRENT — deployed cleanup consumer; no active producer
sequenceDiagram
  participant Producer
  participant Descriptor as assistant-descriptors
  participant Queue as media_retention_queue
  participant Cron as pg_cron every minute
  participant Cleanup as media-retention-cleanup
  participant Media as original private bucket
  Producer->>Descriptor: store durable text descriptor
  Producer->>Queue: enqueue then mark ready
  Cron->>Cleanup: POST with Vault-held secret
  Cleanup->>Queue: select ready rows past delete_after
  Cleanup->>Descriptor: verify descriptor exists
  alt descriptor present
    Cleanup->>Media: remove original
    Cleanup->>Queue: status deleted + deleted_at
  else missing or removal failure
    Cleanup->>Queue: retain row/object and set error_code
  end
  Note over Producer: Current backend produces no media, so no active producer exists.
